sequenceDiagram
    participant KFTO as Kubeflow Training Operator
    participant ConfigMap as PyTorchJob ConfigMap
    participant AccLaunch as accelerate_launch.py<br/>Container Entry Point
    participant SFTTrainer as sft_trainer.py<br/>Core Engine
    participant DataProc as Data Preprocessing<br/>Pipeline
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PVC as Training Data PVC
    participant GPU as GPU (CUDA)
    participant Workers as Other Worker Pods<br/>29500/TCP NCCL
    participant OutputPVC as Output PVC
    participant Tracker as Experiment Tracker<br/>(Aim/MLflow/ClearML)

    Note over KFTO,AccLaunch: Flow 1: Model Fine-Tuning Job

    KFTO->>AccLaunch: Create pod via PyTorchJob
    ConfigMap->>AccLaunch: SFT_TRAINER_CONFIG_JSON_PATH<br/>(JSON config file)
    Note right of AccLaunch: Or SFT_TRAINER_CONFIG_JSON_ENV_VAR<br/>(Base64 encoded, takes precedence)

    AccLaunch->>AccLaunch: Parse config (JSON)<br/>Detect GPU count<br/>Configure FSDP defaults
    AccLaunch->>SFTTrainer: Launch via accelerate<br/>(Python module import)

    SFTTrainer->>HFHub: Download pre-trained model<br/>& tokenizer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (HF_TOKEN)<br/>Encryption: TLS 1.2+
    HFHub-->>SFTTrainer: Model weights + tokenizer

    SFTTrainer->>DataProc: Initialize data pipeline
    DataProc->>PVC: Read training data<br/>(file read, local mount)
    PVC-->>DataProc: Raw training data

    Note over DataProc: Apply DataHandler chain:<br/>map → filter → remove →<br/>select → rename<br/>(Jinja2 sandboxed templates)

    DataProc-->>SFTTrainer: Processed & tokenized dataset

    loop Training Loop (per step/epoch)
        SFTTrainer->>GPU: Forward + backward pass<br/>(CUDA API)
        GPU-->>SFTTrainer: Gradients

        opt Multi-GPU FSDP
            SFTTrainer->>Workers: Gradient sync<br/>Port: 29500/TCP<br/>Protocol: NCCL over TCP<br/>Encryption: Plaintext (intra-cluster)
            Workers-->>SFTTrainer: Synchronized gradients
        end

        SFTTrainer->>SFTTrainer: Optimizer step

        opt Trainer Controller Rules
            Note over SFTTrainer: Evaluate rules via simpleeval<br/>(custom stop criteria,<br/>dynamic logging)
        end

        opt Experiment Tracking
            SFTTrainer->>Tracker: Log metrics<br/>Protocol: HTTP/HTTPS<br/>Auth: Tracker-specific
        end
    end

    SFTTrainer->>OutputPVC: Save model checkpoints<br/>& final model<br/>(safetensors format)
    SFTTrainer->>AccLaunch: Training complete

    Note over AccLaunch,OutputPVC: Flow 2: vLLM Adapter Post-Processing (Optional)

    opt LoRA Adapter Post-Processing
        AccLaunch->>OutputPVC: Read LoRA checkpoint<br/>(file read)
        AccLaunch->>AccLaunch: post_process_vLLM_adapters()
        AccLaunch->>OutputPVC: Write new_embeddings.safetensors<br/>(for vLLM inference)
    end

    AccLaunch->>KFTO: Exit (job complete)
